  <entry>
    <title>Azure/azure-sdk-for-net - Releases - 2025-12-04</title>
    <id>https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net#2025-12-04</id>
    <link href="https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net" />
    <updated>2025-12-05T00:07:28Z</updated>
    <content type="html">
                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/releases/tag/Azure.ResourceManager.Network_1.14.0"&gt;Azure.ResourceManager.Network_1.14.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;1.14.0 (2025-12-04)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Features Added&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Upgraded api-version tag from 'package-2025-01-01' to 'package-2025-03-01'. Tag detail available at &lt;a href="https://github.com/Azure/azure-rest-api-specs/blob/4db9e81042ec3ffd1eee8df1bf2b8489a1e7fa0a/specification/network/resource-manager/readme.md"&gt;https://github.com/Azure/azure-rest-api-specs/blob/4db9e81042ec3ffd1eee8df1bf2b8489a1e7fa0a/specification/network/resource-manager/readme.md&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/releases/tag/Azure.ResourceManager.NetApp_1.15.0-beta.1"&gt;Azure.ResourceManager.NetApp_1.15.0-beta.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;1.15.0-beta.1 (2025-12-01)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Features Added&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Upgraded api-version tag from 'package-2025-09-01' to 'package-2025-09-01-preview'. Tag detail available at &lt;a href="https://github.com/Azure/azure-rest-api-specs/blob/1da0ccefea2127820defac6496bf4710c0902d78/specification/netapp/resource-manager/Microsoft.NetApp/NetApp/readme.md"&gt;https://github.com/Azure/azure-rest-api-specs/blob/1da0ccefea2127820defac6496bf4710c0902d78/specification/netapp/resource-manager/Microsoft.NetApp/NetApp/readme.md&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;code&gt;NetAppCache&lt;/code&gt; resource type&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;code&gt;ElasticAccount&lt;/code&gt; resource type&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;code&gt;ElasticPool&lt;/code&gt; resource type&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;code&gt;ElasticVolume&lt;/code&gt; resource type&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;code&gt;ElasticSnapshotPolicy&lt;/code&gt; resource type&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;code&gt;ElasticSnapshot&lt;/code&gt; resource type&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;code&gt;ElasticBackupVault&lt;/code&gt; resource type&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;code&gt;ElasticBackupPolicy&lt;/code&gt; resource type&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;code&gt;ElasticBackup&lt;/code&gt; resource type&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;code&gt;ActiveDirectory&lt;/code&gt; resource type&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;code&gt;RansomwareReport&lt;/code&gt; resource type, Support for Advance AntiRansomware features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;code&gt;LdapConfiguration&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;NetAppAccountResource&lt;/code&gt; to support LDAP configuration at account level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;code&gt;LargeVolumeType&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;NetAppVolumeResource&lt;/code&gt; to support ExtraLargeVolumes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/releases/tag/Azure.ResourceManager.EventHubs_1.3.0-beta.1"&gt;Azure.ResourceManager.EventHubs_1.3.0-beta.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;1.3.0-beta.1 (2025-11-27)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Features Added&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Updated api version to '2025-05-01-preview'.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/releases/tag/Azure.ResourceManager.DataFactory_1.11.0"&gt;Azure.ResourceManager.DataFactory_1.11.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;1.11.0 (2025-12-01)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Features Added&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added Netezza V2 linked service and dataset definitions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added Jira V2 connector support in Azure Data Factory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added enable/disable Interactive Query management APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;code&gt;clusterResourceGroupAuthType&lt;/code&gt; to the HDInsight OnDemand linked service definition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expanded Snowflake V2 options to cover additional data types.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;code&gt;partitionOption&lt;/code&gt; property for the Salesforce V2 connector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                &lt;/div&gt;
            </content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <title>dotnet/aspire - Releases - 2025-12-04</title>
    <id>https://github.com/dotnet/aspire#2025-12-04</id>
    <link href="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire" />
    <updated>2025-12-05T00:07:35Z</updated>
    <content type="html">
                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/releases/tag/v13.0.2"&gt;Aspire 13.0.2 Release&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;p&gt;This patch is updating our Project Templates for our Python starter app to ensure we depend on the latest version of React. This is out of an abundance of caution, as we don't depend on any of the react packages that were flagged as vulnerable in &lt;a title="GHSA-fv66-9v8q-g76r" data-hovercard-type="advisory" data-hovercard-url="/advisories/GHSA-fv66-9v8q-g76r/hovercard" href="https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-fv66-9v8q-g76r"&gt;GHSA-fv66-9v8q-g76r&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bump patch version from 13.0.1 to 13.0.2 by @Copilot in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3692631984" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/issues/13324" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/aspire/pull/13324/hovercard" href="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/pull/13324"&gt;#13324&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update React and ReactDOM to version 19.2.1 across all projects by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/joperezr/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/joperezr"&gt;@joperezr&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3692712483" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/issues/13325" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/aspire/pull/13325/hovercard" href="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/pull/13325"&gt;#13325&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class="commit-link" href="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/compare/v13.0.1...v13.0.2"&gt;&lt;tt&gt;v13.0.1...v13.0.2&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                &lt;/div&gt;
            </content>
  </entry>
